# Student Answer:
Welcome to 412 Monterey Ave, a true gem located in the heart of the scenic and vibrant Capitola, CA 95010. Nestled in idyllic surroundings, this mesmerizing property offers a unique combination of luxury, comfort, and connectivity with nature's tranquillity.

Boasting an open floorplan that seamlessly blends both comfort and style, this prestigious residence provides the perfect platform for upscale living and refined entertaining. The light-flooded living areas and sophisticated design lines enhance the sense of space, effortlessly leading you to the gourmet kitchen. This culinary paradise showcases exquisite shaker cabinetry, sweeping white Calcatta quartz countertops, and high-end appliances, making it a dream come true for any home chef.

One of the home's undeniable highlights is the captivating window view revealing the encompassing green park and the majestic silhouette of distant mountains. This sanctuary is designed to deliver an indoor-outdoor living experience, granting its residents unparalleled serenity in their daily lives.

With ample parking space for three cars and an additional finished single-car garage, storage will never be an issue at this property. Whether it's storing vehicles, boats, tools or transforming it into a workshop or hobby space, this home leaves room for endless possibilities.

Conveniently located at walking distance from the buzzing town centre with its exquisite restaurants, cafes, and boutiques, this dwelling offers the perfect balance between the vibrant Californian lifestyle and a peaceful sea-side retreat.

We invite you to experience the enchanting charm of 412 Monterey Ave. The sophistication of this residence, coupled with the sublime locale, offers a living experience that's second to none. Don't let this extraordinary opportunity pass - make this dream home your reality today.

